WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.090
SHINING SOUL

00:01:31.950 --> 00:01:37.590
The excitement-filled Asian Tournament has finally reached its climax!

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:40.620
With both teams tied at 1-to-1,
the third match begins now!

00:01:40.940 --> 00:01:43.380
Everything will be decided by this match!

00:01:43.890 --> 00:01:46.540
I'll be watching very carefully.

00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:50.470
These are the two
facing off in the last battle!

00:01:50.780 --> 00:01:53.970
Takao Kinomiya from the BBA Team!

00:01:53.970 --> 00:01:56.400
Lai from the Chinese team!

00:01:56.580 --> 00:01:58.720
Takao, you can do it.

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:00.050
I've got this.

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:05.770
I won't lose.

00:02:07.910 --> 00:02:12.850
The Final Battle!
Dark Lightning!

00:02:13.220 --> 00:02:17.490
There couldn't be a stadium more fitting for the finale of the tournament than...

00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:18.250
this one!

00:02:27.440 --> 00:02:31.830
The historical ruins of Dunhuang, which once separated China from the rest of the world!

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:35.500
Truly the centre of cultural exchanges for the world!

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:39.900
It'll make for some tough battles!

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:42.140
Wow! So cool!

00:02:43.780 --> 00:02:45.700
I'm getting more and more fired up!

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:47.200
You're on <i>fire!</i>

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:48.970
Contestants, take your positions!

00:02:48.970 --> 00:02:49.820
Okay!

00:02:49.820 --> 00:02:50.600
Takao!

00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:52.720
What's up, Professor?

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:54.330
Please, use this.

00:02:55.630 --> 00:02:58.350
This is the Dragoon Shooter I developed.

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:02.510
It will analyze your shoot's power and show it on the LCD screen,

00:03:02.510 --> 00:03:04.700
while allowing for more powerful shoots!

00:03:05.030 --> 00:03:07.500
Really? That's amazing, Professor!

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:09.880
Everything is riding on this match.

00:03:09.980 --> 00:03:11.690
You must win!

00:03:11.690 --> 00:03:13.500
Yeah! Thanks!

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:14.710
I'm off!

00:03:15.640 --> 00:03:18.340
What a beautiful display of friendship.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:20.130
This is all I can do.

00:03:21.270 --> 00:03:25.290
According to my analysis, Lai has an incredible advantage in strength.

00:03:25.290 --> 00:03:28.200
Even if he uses the Dragoon
Shooter, it's possible that...

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:30.570
I-It's possible that... what?

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:37.970
We're unstoppable, now!

00:03:37.970 --> 00:03:39.580
Hope you're ready, Lai!

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:44.440
Watch closely!

00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:51.370
To see who the real successor
to the White Tiger Clan is!

00:03:51.570 --> 00:03:53.810
I'll show you who it really is!

00:03:55.340 --> 00:03:56.400
Lai...

00:03:56.680 --> 00:04:01.310
Look at that! Lai declares
his victory straight to Rei!

00:04:01.310 --> 00:04:05.440
It's like he doesn't even
acknowledge Takao's existence!

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:08.340
Hey! Don't ignore me!

00:04:08.840 --> 00:04:11.100
The first battle! Ready?

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:13.480
Let's show them what
we can do, Dragoon!

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:14.690
Three!

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:15.680
Two!

00:04:16.050 --> 00:04:16.740
One!

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:19.880
Go... Shoot!

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:37.920
Go!

00:04:40.870 --> 00:04:44.220
Uh oh! Galeon is riding on
the edge of the desert section!

00:04:44.440 --> 00:04:47.520
Fall into the desert and you'll
lose your spin in a flash!

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:49.420
Galeon's in trouble!

00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:51.080
Now, Takao!

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:52.230
<i>Good chance!</i>

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:54.080
Finish him off, Dragoon!

00:04:59.170 --> 00:05:00.750
Tiger Claw!

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:13.950
D-Dragoon is out!

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:15.760
The winner is Lai!

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:17.380
- What happened?
- What?

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:18.710
Why'd it just fly out?

00:05:19.150 --> 00:05:21.500
What the heck was that?

00:05:21.690 --> 00:05:24.970
That wasn't a typical Tiger Claw.

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:26.580
Then what was it?

00:05:26.580 --> 00:05:31.770
Indeed, Galeon seems to be fine
after taking Dragoon's attack.

00:05:31.770 --> 00:05:34.400
But right before the final attack,

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:38.900
Galeon increased its rotation
speed for a split second, and dealt out a Tiger Claw!

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:41.250
Its spin and destructive force...

00:05:41.390 --> 00:05:43.340
are both far above Rei's.

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:44.710
<i>Oh no!</i>

00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:48.960
So I don't even have
close to enough power?

00:05:50.340 --> 00:05:55.000
Did you think that I simply
copied your technique?

00:05:56.660 --> 00:06:00.900
I didn't train to
merely catch up to you.

00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:03.730
It was to surpass you, and beat you!

00:06:03.890 --> 00:06:05.930
We are not equals!

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:07.700
Lai...

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:11.280
Say your goodbyes to
Byakko now, before it's too late.

00:06:11.780 --> 00:06:14.800
He's ignoring me again!

00:06:14.800 --> 00:06:16.600
Don't underestimate me!

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:18.600
You're the one underestimating him.

00:06:19.320 --> 00:06:20.760
What's with that, Kai?

00:06:20.760 --> 00:06:22.420
What do you mean?

00:06:22.420 --> 00:06:24.460
What are you, blind?

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:30.340
You're making light of the battle by recklessly
jumping in, and not taking advantage of the stadium.

00:06:31.220 --> 00:06:34.140
Taking advantage
of the stadium?

00:06:35.140 --> 00:06:39.460
Is he saying I haven't been
using it to its full potential?

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:42.140
The second battle!

00:06:42.140 --> 00:06:42.930
Here we go!

00:06:43.150 --> 00:06:45.840
Three! Two! One!

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:47.340
I don't buy that!

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:50.540
Go... Shoot!

00:07:00.950 --> 00:07:03.590
Look at that! Galeon's on the
offense from the start!

00:07:03.590 --> 00:07:06.210
Dragoon's going to fall into the desert section!

00:07:06.210 --> 00:07:10.820
Takao! If you enter the desert,
you'll stop spinning instantly!

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:12.400
I know!

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:18.060
What are you, blind?

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:20.660
Take advantage...

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:22.180
of the stadium...

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:27.840
The desert...

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:29.130
Sand...

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:42.540
Now I get it!

00:07:42.540 --> 00:07:44.080
Let's go, Dragoon!

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:51.360
Oh? Dragoon has jumped into the desert on its own! What could this mean?

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:52.460
Impossible!

00:07:52.460 --> 00:07:53.820
<i>Oh no!</i>

00:07:54.300 --> 00:07:55.570
Have you lost it?

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:57.780
Come at me, Lai.

00:07:58.180 --> 00:08:00.920
Very well. I'll finish you off.

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:02.460
Galeon!

00:08:07.470 --> 00:08:09.260
Tiger Claw!

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:12.880
Now, Storm Attack!

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:16.760
What?!

00:08:42.840 --> 00:08:44.260
It's over!

00:08:44.260 --> 00:08:47.500
The winner is Takao Kinomiya!

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:49.560
He turned the tables!

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:53.230
<i>Wonderful</i>, Takao!

00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:54.220
Incredible!

00:08:54.780 --> 00:08:56.200
Thanks, Kai!

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:58.100
That was some good advice.

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:00.980
Don't celebrate just yet. Look.

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:07.440
I see why Rei chose
you as his teammate.

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:14.200
You're finally looking at <i>me</i>.

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:17.880
He's a fool.

00:09:17.880 --> 00:09:18.620
Yeah.

00:09:18.920 --> 00:09:21.540
For making Lai go all out...

00:09:32.530 --> 00:09:35.640
The score of these finals is even at 1-to-1!

00:09:35.640 --> 00:09:37.600
Only one round left to go!

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:39.440
Hope you're all ready!

00:09:39.440 --> 00:09:41.340
Yeah! We can't wait!

00:09:41.540 --> 00:09:43.480
The final battle! Ready?

00:09:43.820 --> 00:09:46.100
Three! Two! One!

00:09:46.420 --> 00:09:48.600
Go... Shoot!

00:09:51.850 --> 00:09:53.410
Go, Dragoon!

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:57.240
Allow me to show you the
pride of the Byakko Clan!

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:58.930
And my power!

00:09:59.060 --> 00:10:00.410
Awaken, Galeon!

00:10:07.190 --> 00:10:08.430
What's happening?

00:10:11.660 --> 00:10:12.680
What?!

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:14.970
The Black Lion Holy Beast...

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:19.910
Take this! Dark Lightning!

00:10:25.620 --> 00:10:26.860
What is this?

00:10:26.860 --> 00:10:28.940
W-What's this light?

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:30.420
It's a lightning!

00:10:30.420 --> 00:10:35.170
With its powerful rotation, Galeon gathers all the air around it and generates thunder!

00:10:35.710 --> 00:10:37.070
This is the end for you!

00:10:42.180 --> 00:10:44.740
Dragoon has been blown away!

00:10:45.250 --> 00:10:46.580
It's all thanks to you.

00:10:47.350 --> 00:10:48.070
What?!

00:10:48.530 --> 00:10:51.670
My special move was born
from my hatred for you!

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:53.500
Lai!

00:10:53.730 --> 00:10:56.140
This match is mine!

00:10:56.140 --> 00:10:58.180
Don't get ahead of yourself!

00:11:02.780 --> 00:11:03.600
What?!

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:06.560
Our battle isn't over yet!

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:09.650
Dragoon barely made it back!

00:11:10.340 --> 00:11:13.400
Time to put an end to
your needless resistance.

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:14.660
Dark Lightning!

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:18.490
I can't afford to lose.

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:21.430
For Dragoon... for my team!

00:11:21.430 --> 00:11:22.700
Storm Attack!

00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:31.460
There he is! It's Seiryu!

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:44.730
The two contestants are neck and neck!

00:11:50.820 --> 00:11:54.610
This is bad! If this drags on any longer, Dragoon will be at a disadvantage!

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:57.990
Takao's not the kind of
guy to let it end like this.

00:11:58.240 --> 00:12:00.610
Dragoon! Go!

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:29.770
Both players have left the stadium...

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:31.380
This match...

00:12:31.660 --> 00:12:33.120
is a draw!!

00:12:33.870 --> 00:12:36.320
A draw? I can't believe it...

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:42.000
We are currently
working towards a decision,

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:45.320
concerning the unprecedented
draw between both teams!

00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:48.710
There's never been a tie during
the finals before, has there?

00:12:51.570 --> 00:12:54.240
We've got word from the committee.

00:12:54.240 --> 00:12:59.540
A one round match will be held with representatives from both teams.

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:01.220
That will decide the winner!

00:13:01.220 --> 00:13:03.980
Both teams are free to
choose their representative.

00:13:03.980 --> 00:13:06.520
Battle until one comes out a winner.

00:13:06.520 --> 00:13:08.940
That's the name of the
game. Hear that, everyone?

00:13:08.940 --> 00:13:11.560
The match will be held without delay!

00:13:11.690 --> 00:13:12.780
Alright!

00:13:12.780 --> 00:13:13.890
This is awesome!

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:16.900
Yeah, now that's
what I'm talking about!

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:19.650
Both representatives, come forward!

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:20.530
Takao!

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:24.990
Let me go.

00:13:25.680 --> 00:13:26.880
You're gonna go, Rei?

00:13:27.060 --> 00:13:30.000
Wait one moment! According to my data—

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:31.700
Don't worry about it.

00:13:31.810 --> 00:13:33.220
I will win.

00:13:34.140 --> 00:13:35.960
Please, Takao!

00:13:38.640 --> 00:13:41.430
It's a promise. You <i>have to</i> win!

00:13:44.240 --> 00:13:45.200
Rei!

00:13:47.900 --> 00:13:49.360
Rei-nii...

00:13:49.590 --> 00:13:53.060
I knew you'd go out there, Rei-kun.

00:13:53.820 --> 00:13:56.100
This is what I've been waiting for, Rei!

00:13:57.500 --> 00:13:58.160
Lai...

00:13:58.160 --> 00:14:01.310
This will truly be the final round of this long battle.

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:04.440
Simple is best for this stadium!

00:14:04.440 --> 00:14:06.020
It's the Prototype Stadium!

00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:08.590
Asia Tournament, final battle!

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:10.410
It starts now!

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:13.490
Three! Two! One!

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:16.160
Go... Shoot!

00:14:17.020 --> 00:14:18.620
Go, Driger!

00:14:22.440 --> 00:14:25.340
Lai. I'll admit that
you've gotten stronger.

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:27.350
But I cannot lose.

00:14:27.680 --> 00:14:29.940
I can't fall back now!

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:31.860
Tiger Claw!

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:36.390
Do you really think that will work on me?

00:14:36.780 --> 00:14:39.680
I will show you all of my power!

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:48.360
That's Gaou's special move!

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:49.390
The Bear Axe!

00:14:49.390 --> 00:14:50.160
What?!

00:14:58.100 --> 00:15:00.280
And that's the Drunk Monkey Attack!

00:15:11.500 --> 00:15:13.580
No way! Even Caty Bites?!

00:15:13.580 --> 00:15:16.080
How does he know
everyone else's moves?

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:21.290
That's right. Our moves are passed from generation to generation in the Byakko Clan.

00:15:21.490 --> 00:15:24.450
And Lai-nii mastered all of them!

00:15:24.920 --> 00:15:25.880
For real?!

00:15:26.010 --> 00:15:27.410
<i>Unbelievable!</i>

00:15:27.780 --> 00:15:29.680
Lai, you've...

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:32.880
It's too easy to just 'beat' you.

00:15:32.880 --> 00:15:33.840
What?!

00:15:34.020 --> 00:15:37.260
I'm saying that alone
won't soothe my rage!

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:40.530
All I want is Byakko's Bit!

00:15:40.530 --> 00:15:43.200
I'll crush the rest
of it into scrap!

00:15:44.110 --> 00:15:46.930
At this point, the match has now become one-sided!

00:15:47.700 --> 00:15:50.970
Like a wild beast
toying with its prey!

00:15:51.400 --> 00:15:52.870
Get a hold of yourself, Rei!

00:15:52.870 --> 00:15:53.560
Rei!

00:15:56.070 --> 00:15:56.880
This is awful.

00:15:58.120 --> 00:15:59.160
Mao?

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:00.620
This...

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:02.320
This isn't a battle anymore!

00:16:02.320 --> 00:16:02.370
Mao!
This isn't a battle anymore!

00:16:02.370 --> 00:16:02.950
Mao!

00:16:03.200 --> 00:16:05.140
Lai-nii, please, stop!

00:16:05.140 --> 00:16:07.000
This isn't a battle anymore!

00:16:07.240 --> 00:16:08.100
Silence!

00:16:08.100 --> 00:16:08.690
Lai-nii!

00:16:09.010 --> 00:16:10.880
What other choice do I have?!

00:16:11.930 --> 00:16:12.880
How...

00:16:13.620 --> 00:16:16.560
How else am I supposed
to calm my feelings?!

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:21.290
I liked Rei!

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:24.090
I respected him. I wanted to be like him!

00:16:24.360 --> 00:16:28.850
At the time, I even agreed that he
should be the one to take the Byakko Bit!

00:16:29.280 --> 00:16:30.060
Despite that,

00:16:30.290 --> 00:16:32.040
He abandoned his village,

00:16:32.040 --> 00:16:33.470
and turned on me!

00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:37.240
You'd never understand
the frustration I felt back then!

00:16:38.340 --> 00:16:39.100
Galeon!

00:16:49.220 --> 00:16:50.060
Rei...

00:16:51.260 --> 00:16:52.490
Rei-nii...

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:57.840
If I lose now, the path I chose

00:16:57.840 --> 00:17:00.660
and everything I've done
up to now will be pointless!

00:17:02.340 --> 00:17:03.330
It's hopeless.

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:05.630
Rei no longer has
any chance of winning.

00:17:05.630 --> 00:17:06.970
<i>Oh no!</i>

00:17:08.860 --> 00:17:10.440
Get your butt in gear, Rei!

00:17:11.060 --> 00:17:14.380
You promised you'd win
no matter what, didn't you?

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:15.070
Takao...

00:17:15.520 --> 00:17:18.480
I know how strong you are.

00:17:18.480 --> 00:17:19.520
So show it to him, Rei!

00:17:19.900 --> 00:17:24.050
<i>Hey</i>, Rei! Don't forget that
we've got your back, okay?

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:26.020
Max...

00:17:26.840 --> 00:17:28.720
It'll be fine, Rei.

00:17:28.720 --> 00:17:30.780
According to my analysis...

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:33.580
Either way, you'll be okay!

00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:36.080
Professor...

00:17:36.440 --> 00:17:38.720
Time to end this.

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:42.920
I'll make you regret abandoning
your clan by beating you!

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:48.400
Don't make me repeat myself.

00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:49.210
What..?!

00:17:50.140 --> 00:17:53.540
I didn't abandon or betray my clan!

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:59.280
When I left the village, I realized how the world was full of powerful opponents.

00:17:59.490 --> 00:18:02.610
I realized that only by fighting
them and knowing their power,

00:18:02.610 --> 00:18:05.350
I could grow as a <i>true</i> Blader!

00:18:07.630 --> 00:18:08.360
Nonsense.

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:10.550
How would you know?

00:18:10.760 --> 00:18:15.070
You've learned all your moves
<i>alone</i> by piling on hatred!

00:18:17.250 --> 00:18:18.140
Insolence!

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:19.830
Finish him, Galeon!

00:18:24.440 --> 00:18:25.920
Let me show you!

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:29.500
This is the power of a member of the Byakko Clan who has seen the world!

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:31.840
Tiger Claw!

00:18:38.230 --> 00:18:39.000
What?!

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:47.390
- What's that?!
- It's bright!

00:19:12.400 --> 00:19:15.140
T-The winner is Rei!

00:19:15.140 --> 00:19:17.820
It's a miraculous comeback victory!

00:19:21.560 --> 00:19:23.170
You did it, Rei!

00:19:23.170 --> 00:19:24.740
I knew you had it in you!

00:19:24.740 --> 00:19:26.570
Truly a miracle...

00:19:28.240 --> 00:19:29.020
But why..?

00:19:29.480 --> 00:19:31.140
How could I..?

00:19:31.640 --> 00:19:32.820
Just like you, I'm not...

00:19:33.380 --> 00:19:36.220
the same guy you knew back then.

00:19:44.440 --> 00:19:48.920
The Beyblade Asia Tournament has seen its number of exciting battles!

00:19:48.920 --> 00:19:52.660
And the one has won their ticket to take on the rest of the world

00:19:52.660 --> 00:19:54.170
is the BBA team!

00:19:55.640 --> 00:19:57.080
We won!

00:19:57.080 --> 00:19:59.280
We won the championship!

00:19:59.280 --> 00:20:01.390
<i>Banzai! Banzai!</i>

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:04.470
You had us worried there, Rei.

00:20:04.610 --> 00:20:06.850
Sorry. But it was a little rough.

00:20:06.850 --> 00:20:09.500
A "little"? Well aren't
you a tough talker?

00:20:09.880 --> 00:20:11.560
Hold off on the celebrations.

00:20:11.960 --> 00:20:14.480
All this means is that
we passed the qualifiers.

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:16.480
The real battles
are from here on out.

00:20:16.630 --> 00:20:17.500
Indeed!

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:21.300
Either way, those were
some incredible battles, boys.

00:20:21.300 --> 00:20:22.480
Rei-nii!

00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:24.060
Mao?

00:20:24.480 --> 00:20:26.540
Congratulations, Rei-nii!

00:20:26.540 --> 00:20:27.360
Yeah.

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:29.520
That was so cool, Rei!

00:20:29.520 --> 00:20:33.400
It was an amazing battle I would
have never seen back in the village.

00:20:33.400 --> 00:20:38.720
I bet you've gotten stronger after leaving
the village and eating all sorts of good food.

00:20:38.720 --> 00:20:40.460
More or less!

00:20:49.060 --> 00:20:50.100
Lai...

00:20:54.140 --> 00:20:55.880
The world...

00:20:55.880 --> 00:20:57.280
is truly vast.

00:20:58.500 --> 00:20:59.030
Lai...

00:20:59.200 --> 00:21:03.020
I get the feeling I'm beginning to understand how you feel that

00:21:03.020 --> 00:21:06.820
seeing the world means expanding the future of the Byakko Clan.

00:21:08.280 --> 00:21:11.080
Go out into the world!

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:14.740
Go and further expand the
power of the Byakko Clan!

00:21:14.740 --> 00:21:15.980
You bet!

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:22.360
Now then, next will be the American Tournament.

00:21:22.360 --> 00:21:25.720
I'll be looking forward
to more fantastic battles.

00:21:26.000 --> 00:21:27.760
Alright, guys!

00:21:27.760 --> 00:21:31.260
Let's show America what we've got!

00:21:31.260 --> 00:21:34.320
Yeah!

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:58.060 --> 00:23:02.760
According to my analysis, we won!

00:23:02.760 --> 00:23:05.740
The next tournament will be in <i>America</i>!

00:23:05.740 --> 00:23:09.180
In the mean time we went back in Japan after a long time, and wow!

00:23:09.180 --> 00:23:12.660
The BBA Team has become a star!

00:23:12.660 --> 00:23:16.140
And the two boys we meet..!

00:23:17.800 --> 00:23:20.660
Next time: Don't Lose! The Little Bladers.

00:23:21.060 --> 00:23:24.760
Come to think of it, Kai's
been acting a little weird.
